  <section id="how-to-read">
    <h2>How to read this page</h2>
    <p>
      This is a profile post that is, for most of its length,
      <strong>the same text as the 2011 eSyria article</strong>
      (<a href={esyria}>page here</a>), without credit to it. It adds a few
      things. It is also someone else’s published work, so I have
      <strong>not</strong> translated it in full. This page summarizes only
      what is new, translates four short passages, and lists what to check. For
      the shared material, please see the eSyria page. Please have an Arabic
      reader check my translations.
    </p>
    <p>
      <mark>Highlighted text marked “Review”</mark> is something I’m unsure of
      or that disagrees with another source on this site. The post gives no
      references.
    </p>
